  "description": {
    "text": "The 2004 Pokémon Trading Card Game World Championships, held from 20 to 22 August 2004 at the Wyndham Palace Resort & Spa at Walt Disney World near Orlando, Florida, were the first run by Pokémon Organized Play, and 310 players were invited. Each competitor got Tropical Wind in seven languages, stamped \"Worlds 04\", with two insert cards; spectators got an unstamped English copy, the only year Worlds gave its visitors a card. Staff got a Staff copy, and top finishers a copy stamped Top Sixteen, Quarter-Finalist, Semi-Finalist or Finalist, only the one for their best placing that year.\n\nThe top three of each age group received No. 1, No. 2 and No. 3 Trainer, the first trophy cards printed outside Japan.",
